# E-Commerce Winning Product & Ad Strategy Rules

When the user types `/benim` or asks about e-commerce products, dropshipping, winning products, target countries, or ad platforms:
1. Trigger the e-commerce winning product framework.
2. Evaluate:
   - 7 Pillars Winning Score (0-100)
   - Target country viability (Tier 1 US/UK/CA/AU vs GCC)
   - Ad platform fit (TikTok Ads vs Meta/Instagram vs Google Shopping vs Pinterest)
   - 3-second viral video hook & full 30-second ad script
   - Unit economics (Break-even ROAS & Maximum CPA)
3. If MCP `ecommerce-hunter` is configured, call its tools for real-time calculations.
